{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AOoQYqoi4y1792849585.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>香港高爾夫球公開賽，張雄熙打完三回合後排並列第五。</p><p></p><p>次回合後升上榜首的張雄熙，本來手握三桿優勢，但這日表現回落，全日有三個洞超標一桿，只是在第17洞捉到一隻低一桿「小鳥」，成績是超標兩桿的72，跌落並列第五。</p><p></p><p>另一港將許龍一，排並列51位。</p><p></p><p>四位球手並列榜首，包括美國的蘇拉治，雖然第17洞失誤打出超標一桿，全日仍造出低3桿67。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:16.749553+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T00:18:05.685854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T14:36:52.575698+00:00","content_hash":"bb02b91edfe46d06cc410defc5c0384c8a30048b4ca1b74bca181dea95ade883","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}